"Caspian underwent the forbidden Landwalker ritual with a rare tidepearl and grew legs."
"For it, merfolk law exiled him and declared him dead; his city's gates are shut to him forever."
"His Landwalker skill is at Expert: 10 hours on legs in Cee's tidesilk, then 3 hours in water."
"Old texts say Landwalker at its height becomes a trait, letting him switch forms at will."
"He cured the corruption curse on Liora's leg, which her own Purify could only soothe."
"Now he is the anthill's ant doctor, in a deep chamber with a water basin."
"He hates the work, which reminds him of his city, and wants to leave."
